# =====================================================================
#  ST.LiquorTNT solution .gitignore
#  Lives next to ST.LiquorTNT.sln and covers everything under it:
#    src/ST.LiquorTNT.*            (ASP.NET Core API, libraries, desktop)
#    src/ST.LiquorTNT.WebApplication (React + Vite, .esproj)
#    tests/
#  Patterns are relative / unanchored, so this file keeps working if the
#  solution folder is moved up one level later.
# =====================================================================


